  m_Name: Note_BoatFisherman
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NoteName: Boat Note
  NoteHeader: Things To Know
  NoteText: "Paying your Debt\r\n-Not expecting it all immediately, but that doesn't
    mean no deadlines. Calendar on the ship'll show you how long you\u2019ve got,
    I wouldn\u2019t recommend falling behind schedule.\r\nUsing The Boat\r\n-Fuel
    you can come buy from me, or if you run out mid-sail you can turn some fish into
    fuel with the little contraption at the front of the boat \r\nGetting Fish\r\n-The
    islands and whatever else you find have different kinds of inhabiting fish, most
    of which sell for a good premium. If you want to pay that debt don't skip on
    it\r\n\r\n-The Merchant \r\n"
